{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1286518-gen-lock","id":1286518,"title":"Gen:Lock","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-02-10T13:00:03-08:00","id":1286518,"title":"Gen:Lock","content":"Since I know there's a bit of a RWBY fandom around here, I thought I'd see if there's any adjacent interest.<br /> <br /> For those not in the know, <a href=\"https://roosterteeth.com/series/gen-lock\" target=\"_blank\">Gen:Lock</a> is a Rooster Teeth original animated mecha show that premiered in late January. The first season is planned to have eight episodes, released weekly. Unfortunately, only the first episode will be available for non-First members, but the reaction community can still react to it a week after release, so there will be a way to watch it for free. Just not, y'know, in an optimal shape.<br /> <br /> I think it's relevant to Exalted as inspirational material, since the Gen:Lock process have heavy similarities to drawing a Second Breath. Alternatively, they could be seen as Warstrider inspiration. But really, whatever criticism can be levied at Rooster Teeth original animations, they've always been very Exalted-friendly, and this show doesn't change that.<br /> <br /> Right now, the fourth episode is out, marking the halfway point, and I must say... I think this is <i>much</i> better than RWBY. Like, head and shoulders above. I'm not even that into mecha, but this really does it for me. Anyone else watching this show? Anyone getting any Exalted vibes?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-10T14:10:10-08:00","id":1286533,"title":"","content":"I'm watching it, and yeah, it's good. <br /> <br /> The holons are cool. Kinda warstriders, kinda colossus alchemicals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-10T16:31:04-08:00","id":1286572,"title":"","content":"The Gen:Lock system is essentially an artifact to itself, separate from the Holon warstriders.<br /> <br /> Without it, the holons are useless, as they have no cockpits. But the combination of this one massive, vulnerable artifact with a holon provides better results than a pilot could get with a normal warstrider.<br /> <br /> &quot;Overclocking&quot; is one benefit, as is the telepathic communication possibilities between pilots uploaded through the same Gen:Lock engine.<br /> <br /> Another benefit is avoiding the Strength minimums for maximum warstrider Strength.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-10T17:58:04-08:00","id":1286590,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1286518-gen-lock?p=1286572#post1286572\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Gen:Lock system is essentially an artifact to itself, separate from the Holon warstriders.<br /> <br /> Without it, the holons are useless, as they have no cockpits. But the combination of this one massive, vulnerable artifact with a holon provides better results than a pilot could get with a normal warstrider.<br /> <br /> &quot;Overclocking&quot; is one benefit, as is the telepathic communication possibilities between pilots uploaded through the same Gen:Lock engine.<br /> <br /> Another benefit is avoiding the Strength minimums for maximum warstrider Strength.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd make it a manse function before an artifact - although this kind of stuff demands a large supply of hearthstones. Well, we can draw from autochtonian frameworks there, or design manses that create multiple hearthstones that are only useful to power artifacts that demand them. Typically warstriders.<br /> <br /> Then again the whole thing is sorta mobile... mhmmmm","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":32,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","user":"Synapse","date":". 02-10-2019, 09:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-10T19:01:16-08:00","id":1286599,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Synapse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1286518-gen-lock?p=1286590#post1286590\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Then again the whole thing is sorta mobile... mhmmmm</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, the Gen:Lock system can be transported on a big enough airship.<br /> <br /> A manse would still be important for the hearthstones, but the system isn't otherwise tied to a manse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-11T00:57:25-08:00","id":1286638,"title":"","content":"*whistles* Magitech... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> Watching with interest. Wouldn't call it better than RWBY yet; higher budget but they're keeping enough setting details mysterious and the plot hasn't really big time kicked off yet. There's a lot of promise here, I just wanna see if it sticks the landing as it were.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4086-croakamancer","name":"Croakamancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4086_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-11T01:22:08-08:00","id":1286641,"title":"","content":"So there's that thing in the new episode, what do you think necrotech or hellstrider? I mean the jerky motions it has at the start and the death cloud I feel scream Soulsteel necrotech warstrider to me. Like its entrance really had me thinking this was a zombie mech. On the other hand the part where it goes full on four armed rampaging monster screamed demonbeast to me as well.<br /> Well if nothing else I look forward to using this as resources for describing warstrider combat.*<br /> <br /> <br /> *Also sound track, but what can I say that's me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3400,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","user":"nalak42","date":". 02-24-2019, 01:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-11T04:45:33-08:00","id":1286664,"title":"","content":"I'm really enjoying it.<br /> It doesn't really scream Exalted warstrider combat like Voltron did, but it's honestly nice to enjoy a show/movie on its own merits and not the components I could steal for inspiration.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-11T12:11:52-08:00","id":1286805,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Croakamancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1286518-gen-lock?p=1286638#post1286638\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">*whistles* Magitech... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Watching with interest. Wouldn't call it better than RWBY yet; higher budget but they're keeping enough setting details mysterious and the plot hasn't really big time kicked off yet. There's a lot of promise here, I just wanna see if it sticks the landing as it were.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, that's fair. Money is a big reason for the big production values, I'm sure. The story could still crash and burn. But the episodes are standard full-length, and there seems to be a dramatic curve in each one that makes it stand more on it's own. If that's what money buys, I'm for it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-11T13:34:44-08:00","id":1286828,"title":"","content":"The fights are nice but kind of hard to follow. Does that have anything to do with the lower frame rate?<br /> <br /> When RWBY switched to a lower frame rate when its giant robot popped the drill, it was noticeably bad to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":636,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","user":"Sunder the Gold","date":". 02-23-2019, 09:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T11:50:43-08:00","id":1289603,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1286518-gen-lock?p=1286641#post1286641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> So there's that thing in the new episode, what do you think necrotech or hellstrider? I mean the jerky motions it has at the start and the death cloud I feel scream Soulsteel necrotech warstrider to me. Like its entrance really had me thinking this was a zombie mech. On the other hand the part where it goes full on four armed rampaging monster screamed demonbeast to me as well.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Well if nothing else I look forward to using this as resources for describing warstrider combat.*<br /> <br /> <br /> *Also sound track, but what can I say that's me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nemesis really makes me think Hungry Ghost style.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T12:39:15-08:00","id":1289613,"title":"","content":"anyone looking at the new gear on the holons and thinking this is a good example of warstrider charms?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T13:11:30-08:00","id":1289622,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1286518-gen-lock?p=1289613#post1289613\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">anyone looking at the new gear on the holons and thinking this is a good example of warstrider charms?</div> </div> </div> </div>You mean, developing Charms, for new warstriders with no previous history or prior master to discover its potentials?<br /> <br /> The holons we see in the intro are very different and differentiated beasts compared to the uniform designs of the originals, so we knew from the beginning that the super-scientist, the long-suffering tech crews, and Cammie would be working to upgrade and modify the machines.<br /> <br /> Which may be a &quot;development&quot; path that we have to wait until the Alchemical Exalted to see presented in this game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T13:28:27-08:00","id":1289627,"title":"","content":"Fine, I suck at this. I'll stop","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-19T13:31:13-08:00","id":1289630,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1286518-gen-lock?p=1289627#post1289627\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fine, I suck at this. I'll stop</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't understand.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name